#. <CLT 4>芝刈り機だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a lawnmower here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có một cái máy cắt cỏ ở đây...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>誰が、芝の手入れを…？
#. モノクマにこれは扱えないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Who's taking care of the lawn? It can't be Monokuma,\n"
"can it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>植木鉢か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So many flowerpots...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、職員室の花って…
#. ここの鉢で育てたのかもな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe these are where the flowers in the office were\n"
"grown.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>肥料だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Bags of fertilizer are piled up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Những bao phân bón được xếp chồng lên nhau.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>色々あるんだな。
#. 用途によって使い分けてるんだろうか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all different kinds. I guess each one has a\n"
"different use.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>農具か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are different kinds of gardening tools here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かが使ってるのだろうか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Have they ever even been used?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このツルハシ…？
#. 柄の部分に字が彫り込んであるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? There's something carved into the handle of this\n"
"pickaxe...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 暮威慈畏…大亜紋土…？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Crazy...diamond...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どこかで…見覚えがあるような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I remember seeing that...somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビニールシート…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A tarp...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Một tấm bạt...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる点は…ないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There isn't anything here that catches my eye...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>物置から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the toolshed?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi kho dụng cụ?\n"
"<CLT>"
